  "description": "Take a step further, keeping an eye on the road. The Blend Road 105 Di2 is the next step towards taking road cycling seriously. With electronic shifting and 2x12 gears, you can technically keep up with the top groups. It remains a real Blend – flexible and robust even in everyday use, with a comfortable geometry that’s ideal for long distances too. Highlights: • Carbon fork – less weight and more comfort • 40 mm tyre clearance – also suitable for wide tyres • Hydraulic disc brakes – safe braking without compromise • Integrated cable routing – a clean look and more space on the handlebar • Ground-down weld seams – seamless transitions, just like with carbon • Mounting points1 for top tube bags – your essentials always to hand • Ready for everyday life – mudguard and kickstand separately available • UDH mounting standard – future-proof for all shifting systems The Blend Road 105 Di2 comes with Shimano’s electronic 105 groupset, featuring 2x12 gears and a fast gearing – an aluminium road bike with a sporty focus. The 28 mm tyres on Rose R25 wheels roll smoothly and quickly in all weathers. A slim saddle from Selle Italia also provides a sporty fit and remains comfortable for hours – perfect for long rides and high-intensity training sessions. Weight: approx. 9.4 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for moss green frame, size M, without pedals.",
